{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-05_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-05","title":"官僚主義","storyCode":"4-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"cf20e2a5f5a65b0efe7de817774f77c5e2e9be59f88e4263f5152048b6f9e24e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陳終於鬆口，決定與羅德島合作。\n而與凱爾希交流過後，阿米婭決定前去營救隕星小隊。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此......我們已經沒有別的選擇。如果陳長官拒絕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼羅德島就會單方面出動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"況且這一行為，並不破壞羅德島與龍門之間的合約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局當然會去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我代表羅德島感謝陳長官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，感染者對於龍門而言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，我對於近衛局各個小隊是否能突入分城內部還有一定的疑慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將見機行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可能的話，我們一定會幫助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但近衛局依然會以處理整合運動這一任務為最優先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣......這樣就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你，陳長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我有自己的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"設備另一頭的那個醫生，聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我會與羅德島一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，小心點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"事情並不單純。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我會小心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我陸續建立了一些綜合情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島已經派出了救援小隊，協助其他參與任務的偵察小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只不過隕星他們所在的地方，我們無法深入，無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這要靠你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只有隕星她們嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。我會去找她們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會將把座標發送給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記住，一切以安全為最優先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，什麼時候出發？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我去整備。你通知一下近衛局的其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，十分鐘之後，我們一起出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一定要平安無事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
